://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOREJyeTROcm1xdVNqMjFVM1NPekxHd1FGbHdETnhfeWVrdklOSTRtR19sVzMwX2QxQ25MUmdpeUpzTUZ0LXY5WFN0Wm00UFdiX0MzbEptQURnWDc5RGpMMXFaSHNpWlI5ZGswcW45V0VnTjZpa191eHYzMFlJaDJYY2V4TlhXWkhuVW1yX2I5SXh4QVE1?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"隨著房地產貓價下降，Brown & Brown 第三季營收成長"},{"title":"Brown & Brown (BRO) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","src":"The Globe and Mail","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOMVp5UUMwWm80Q2E3TDYxRVZ0VXpsNW9pYkVDMUxNWTBVemlMZkdyb3ZZUUtYSW9zVHZ6X2h0T3FKUmVPZU5vMmo3cmpaNEl4SjR2V1k5V1B2eEVscU9xVGUwbVo2Nk1rdDV4eHZWdzFnaGxkdGVxZTdSUzJHRU5YbnowdF9pamdTajdncXBNQjhYMmJNT2JDN3NHeXEyQ0RWbVNqREtfekU3akQxVU9JZVlMNGR3dlJraU12dnNfdGVGQ0pEMldGYXhJM2E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Brown & Brown (BRO) 2026 年第三季財報電話會議紀錄"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/79282/000119312526046984/bro-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Brown & Brown, Inc., a Florida corporation, and its subsidiaries (collectively, \"Brown & Brown\" or the \"Company\") is a diversified insurance agency, wholesale brokerage, insurance programs and service organization that markets and sells insurance products and services, primarily in the property, casualty and employee benefits areas.","zh":"Brown & Brown, Inc. 是一家位於佛羅裡達州的公司及其子公司（統稱為「Brown & Brown」或「公司」），是一家多元化的保險代理、批發經紀、保險計劃和服務組織，主要在財產、傷亡和員工福利領域行銷和銷售保險產品和服務。"},{"en":"The Company primarily operates as an agent or broker not assuming underwriting risks. However, we also operate and/or participate in various ancillary insurance operations, including (1) reinsurance companies and stand-alone captives that assume underwriting risk; (2) series captive insurance companies (\"SCICs\"); (3) protected cell companies; (4) segregated account companies; (5) a quota share captive and (6) an excess of loss layer captive (collectively, the \"Captives\"). These ancillary insurance operations facilitate additional underwriting capacity, generate incremental revenues and/or enable the Company to participate in certain underwriting results. The Company also operates a write-your-own flood insurance carrier, Wright National Flood Insurance Company (\"WNFIC\"). WNFIC's underwriting business consists of policies written pursuant to the National Flood Insurance Program (\"NFIP\"), ","zh":"該公司主要作為代理人或經紀人運營，不承擔承銷風險。然而，我們也經營和/或參與各種輔助保險業務，包括（1）再保險公司和承擔承保風險的獨立自保公司； (2) 系列自保保險公司（「SCIC」）； (3) 受保護的細胞公司； (4) 獨立帳戶公司； (5) 配額份額自保公司和 (6) 超額損失層自保公司（統稱「自保公司」）。這些輔助保險業務有助於增加承保能力，產生增量收入和/或使公司能夠參與某些承保結果。該公司還經營一家自營洪水保險公司，即萊特國家洪水保險公司（「WNFIC」）。 WNFIC 的承保業務包括根據國家洪水保險計劃（「NFIP」）承保的保單、"},{"en":"In conjunction with the acquisition of RSC, the holding company for Accession Risk Management Group, Inc., in the third quarter of 2025, the Company realigned its business from three to two segments. As a result of the segment reorganization, the Company consolidated its Programs and Wholesale Brokerage segments into a new Specialty Distribution segment. The Company now reports its financial results in the following two reportable segments: Retail and Specialty Distribution. The historical results, discussion and presentation of our business segments as set forth in the accompanying Consolidated Financial Statements reflect the impact of these changes for all periods presented in order to present segment information on a comparable basis. There is no impact on our previously reported consolidated statements of income, balance sheets, statements of cash flows, statements of comprehensive ","zh":"在 2025 年第三季收購 Accession Risk Management Group, Inc. 的控股公司 RSC 的同時，公司將業務從三個部門調整為兩個部門。由於部門重組，公司將其計劃和批發經紀部門合併為新的專業分銷部門。該公司現在在以下兩個可報告部門報告其財務業績：零售和專業分銷。隨附的合併財務報表中列出的我們業務部門的歷史結果、討論和列報反映了這些變更對所有列報期間的影響，以便在可比較的基礎上列報部門資訊。對我們先前報告的合併損益表、資產負債表、現金流量表、綜合財務報表沒有影響"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"No material part of our Retail segment is attributable to a single customer or a few customers. During 2025, commissions and fees from our largest single Retail segment customer represented 0.6% of the Retail segment's total commissions and fees.","zh":"我們的零售部門的任何重要部分均不屬於單一客戶或少數客戶。 2025 年，來自我們最大的單一零售部門客戶的佣金和費用佔零售部門總佣金和費用的 0.6%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The insurance intermediary business is highly competitive, and numerous firms actively compete with us for customers and insurance markets. Competition in the insurance business is largely based upon innovation, knowledge, understanding of terms and conditions of coverage, quality of service and price. A number of firms with substantially greater resources and market presence compete with us.","zh":"保險中介業務競爭激烈，許多機構積極與我們爭取客戶和保險市場。保險業的競爭主要基於創新、知識、對承保條款和條件的理解、服務品質和價格。許多擁有更多資源和市場影響力的公司與我們競爭。"},{"en":"A number of insurance companies directly sell insurance, primarily to individuals or small enterprises, and as a result do not pay commissions to third-party agents and brokers. In addition, internet and startup technology companies continue to be a source for direct placement of personal lines or small business insurance. We have our own technology capabilities to also serve personal lines and small businesses. While it is difficult to quantify the impact on our business from individuals or small businesses purchasing insurance over the internet, we believe this risk would generally be isolated to personal lines customers with single-line coverage, or small businesses that do not have a complex insurance program, which represent a small portion of our overall Retail and Specialty Distribution segments.","zh":"許多保險公司主要向個人或小型企業直接銷售保險，因此不向第三方代理人和經紀人支付佣金。此外，網路和新創科技公司仍是直接投放個人險種或小型企業保險的來源。我們擁有自己的技術能力，也可以為個人線路和小型企業提供服務。雖然很難量化個人或小型企業透過網路購買保險對我們業務的影響，但我們認為這種風險通常只限於擁有單線保險的個人客戶或沒有複雜保險計劃的小型企業，這些客戶只占我們整個零售和專業分銷部門的一小部分。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Retail","val":3406000000,"zh":"零售部門"},{"name":"Specialty Distribution","val":2409000000,"zh":"專業分銷"}],"total":5902000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Core Commission Revenue","val":3941000000,"zh":"核心佣金收入"},{"name":"Fee Revenue","val":1278000000,"zh":"手續費收入"},{"name":"Profit Sharing Contingent Commission Revenue","val":255000000,"zh":"利潤分享或有佣金收入"},{"name":"Other Supplemental Commissions Revenue","val":206000000,"zh":"其他補充佣金收入"},{"name":"Earned Premium","val":83000000,"zh":"賺取保費"}],"total":5902000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":5059000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other International Countries","val":843000000,"zh":"其他國際國家"},{"name":"GB","val":599000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"Other Country","val":244000000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":5902000000}},"peers":["AJG","WRB","WST","AON","FDS"]}}